Description: Build tab contents on the main thread.
 GTK widgets were created in a worker thread; a GtkTextView built off the main
 thread is laid out with a NULL default style and crashes. The probing thread
 only runs commands and is left as is.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-21
